score 0.1
# 来路  The Road Behind
#   Movement I of bgm.score, arranged as one through-composed piece. 4:02.
#
# Legend (score 0.1)
#   Pitches sound as written. Durations w h q e s, "." dotted, "+" ties (w+s), r = rest.
#   Counts 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 &; "2.3&" = bar 2 of the chord (or of the section, in a "once" part).
#   Chord tones: bass; t1-t4 / v1-v6 low to high; top; chord = all; upper = all but the lowest;
#     fifth = the chord tone nearest a fifth above the bass.
#   Shifts: +5th (a perfect fifth up, in the chord or not) +8va +15ma +8vb +15mb.
#   Dynamics: pppp .10  ppp .16  pp .22  p .32  mp .42  mf .50  f .55;
#     ">" accent +.08, soft -.07, softer -.14; "ppp-mf" on a roll rises across its notes.
#   roll X: notes enter X apart. late X: enters X after the count.
#   overlap X: each note rings X past its value. ring X: each note rings for X.
#   "1 Ped." presses or changes the sustain pedal; "4& *" lifts it.
#   doubles P: plays P's notes on its own instrument. inner: engraved as a voice of its own on the staff.
#   Form: a row plays only the parts it names. 85% shades a part; "92%-75%" shades bar by bar;
#     "bars 3-4"; "on 1 and 3"; breath = all but lead and once parts stop for the last eighth;
#     cut = whatever still rings stops at the downbeat. "in E" moves the section to E.
#   form loop / loop from A1: the form repeats, from the top or from A1.
#   Variants edit every form row: "drop P", "Q for P", "P <options>".
#   mix: playback balance only. Text after "—" is a note to the reader.
#
#   lead: the tune. Breaths leave it ringing, and a piano lead is engraved as the melody.

title   来路  The Road Behind
by      Innei & Claude
after   邱有句《云村的告别》

instruments
  piano    piano
  harp     harp
  violins  violins
  cello    cello

piece road  来路  The Road Behind
  meter   4/4
  tempo   q = 80
  key     D major

  chords prelude  — bass | voicing
    D        D2  | D4 F#4 A4
    G/D      D2  | B3 D4 G4
    D
    A/C#     C#2 | C#4 E4 A4

  chords theme
    D
    A/C#
    Bm       B1  | B3 D4 F#4
    F#m/A    A1  | A3 C#4 F#4
    G        G2  | B3 D4 G4
    D/F#     F#2 | A3 D4 F#4
    Em7      E2  | B3 D4 E4 G4
    A        A2  | A3 C#4 E4 A4

  chords turn
    G
    A        A2  | A3 C#4 E4
    F#m7     F#2 | A3 C#4 E4
    Bm
    Em7      E2  | G3 B3 D4
    A/C#
    G
    A7       A2  | A3 C#4 E4 G4

  chords lift  — the dominant of the new key
    A7sus4   A1  | E3 A3 D4 E4

  chords coda
    G
    D/F#
    Em7      E2  | B3 D4 E4 G4
    A        A2  | A3 C#4 E4 A4
    G
    D/F#
    Em7
    G

  chords fine
    D        D2  | D3 D4 D5

  part theme  piano  mf  overlap e  lead
    | F#5 h   E5 q   D5 q  | E5 h.   A4 q         | D5 h    F#5 h       | A5 h    F#5 q   E5 q |
    | D5 h    B4 q   D5 q  | F#5 h   A5 q   F#5 q | E5 h    D5 q   B4 q | E5 w                 |

  part turn  piano  mf  overlap e  lead
    | D5 q.   E5 e   D5 q   B4 q  | C#5 h.   A4 q        | A4 q   C#5 q   E5 q   F#5 q | F#5 h.   E5 e   D5 e |
    | D5 q.   E5 e   G5 q   F#5 e   E5 e | E5 h   C#5 q   A4 q | B4 q   D5 q   G5 q   F#5 e   G5 e | A5 h   G5 q   E5 q |

  part coda  piano  overlap e  lead  — the theme's close, climbing into the next octave
    | mf D5 h   B4 q   D5 q  | F#5 h   A5 q   F#5 q | E5 h   D5 q   B4 q | E5 h   C#5 q   A5 q |
    | mp D6 h   B5 q   D6 q  | F#6 h   A6 q   F#6 q | E6 h   D6 q   B5 q | B5 h   A5 h         |

  part violin-theme  violins  doubles theme  overlap s  lead  — the theme an octave under the piano

  part violin-turn  violins  doubles turn  overlap s  lead

  part flow  piano  — dynamic from the form
    1     bass        w   >
    1&    fifth       q.  soft
    2     bass+8va    q.
    2&    t2          q.  soft
    3     t3          q.
    3&    t2          q.  soft
    4     bass+8va    q.
    4&    t1          q.  soft

  part stream  piano  inner
    1     t1+8va      q   softer  late s
    1&    t3          q   softer  late s
    2     t2+8va      q   softer  late s
    2&    t1+8va      q   softer  late s
    3     t3+8va      q   softer  late s
    3&    t2+8va      q   softer  late s
    4     t1+8va      q   softer  late s
    4&    t3          q   softer  late s

  part sparse  piano
    1     bass        w   >
    1     chord       h   soft    roll 30ms
    3     upper       h   softer  roll 40ms

  part drone  piano
    1     bass        w   >

  part cello-pad  cello  f
    1     bass+8va    w+s

  part violin-pad  violins
    1     t2+8va      w+s   late 40ms
    1     top+8va     w+s   late 75ms

  part pizz  violins pizz.  mf
    2     t1+8va      e
    4     t3+8va      e

  part pedal  — a change with every chord
    1     Ped.

  part turn-pedal  once  — the scale in bar 5 gets its own change
    5.3   Ped.

  part harp-roll  harp  once  — on the odd bars
    1.1   t1+8va t2+8va t3+8va bass+15ma   h.  roll s
    3.1   t1+8va t2+8va t3+8va bass+15ma   h.  roll s
    5.1   t1+8va t2+8va t3+8va bass+15ma   h.  roll s
    7.1   t1+8va t2+8va t3+8va bass+15ma   h.  roll s

  part wash  harp  once
    1.1   D4 F#4 A4 D5 F#5 A5 D6   h.  roll s

  part wash-iv  harp  once
    5.1   G3 B3 D4 G4 B4 D5 G5     h.  roll s

  part gliss  harp  once  — up into the next section
    8.4   A3 B3 C#4 D4 E4 F#4 G4 A4 B4 C#5   h  ppp-mp  roll 75ms

  part pickup-d  piano  once  lead  — the pedal lifts as the pickup starts
    4.4   *
    4.4   D5   e.  mp soft
    4.4&  E5   e.  mp soft

  part pickup-b  piano  once  lead
    8.4&  B4   e   mp
    8.4&  C#5  e   mp  late s

  part lift  once
    1.1   piano    A1                 w    mp  >
    1.1   piano    E3 A3 D4           h    p        roll 30ms
    1.3   piano    E3 G3 C#4          h    mp  soft roll 30ms
    1.3   Ped.
    1.1   cello    A2                 w+s  mf
    1.2&  harp     A3 B3 C#4 D4 E4 F#4 G4 A4 B4 C#5 D5 E5 F#5 G5 A5   h  ppp-mf  roll 120ms

  part lift-strings  violins  once
    1.1   D5    h     p
    1.3   C#5   h+s   p
    1.1   E5    w+s   pp   late 60ms

  part coda-entry  once  — the band drops out under a low G and a falling harp
    1.1   piano    G1    w    mf  >
    1.1   piano    G2    w    mp
    1.1   harp     G5 D5 B4 G4 D4 B3 G3   h.  mp  roll 112.5ms

  part coda-strings  violins  once
    1.1   G5    h.    mp
    1.1   D5    h.    p    late 30ms

  part final  piano  once  — the tonic, left to ring under the pedal
    1.1   Ped.
    1.1   bass         w+w  p
    1.1   bass+8va     w+w  ppp
    1.1   top          w+w  p   soft  late 20ms
    1.1   harp  top+8va  w+w  pp  late 50ms

  form  — mark, chords, then who plays
    Intro  prelude  — 序
      wash mp, stream p 85%, drone pp 85% bars 1-2, flow p 70% bars 3-4,
      cello-pad 45% bars 3-4, violin-pad pp, pedal, breath, pickup-d
    A1  theme  — 来路 I
      flow p 85%, theme 85%, pedal
    A2  theme  — 来路 II
      flow mp, stream mp, cello-pad, theme, pedal, breath, pickup-b
    B1  turn  — 回望
      flow p 70%, cello-pad 90%, violin-pad p, harp-roll p, turn, pedal, turn-pedal, breath, gliss
    A3  theme  — 来路 III
      flow mp, stream mp, cello-pad, violin-pad pppp, wash mf, wash-iv p, theme 8va, violin-theme mf, pedal
    A4  theme  — 余音
      sparse mp 85%, cello-pad 50%, pizz, theme 85% on 1 and 3, pedal, breath
    Lift  lift in E  — 升
      lift, lift-strings, pedal
    A5  theme in E  — 来路 IV
      flow mp, stream mp, cello-pad, violin-pad mf, theme, pedal
    B2  turn in E  — 回望
      flow mp 75%, cello-pad 90%, harp-roll p, turn, violin-turn mp, pedal, turn-pedal, breath, gliss
    A6  theme in E  — 来路 V
      flow mf, stream mf, cello-pad, violin-pad pppp, wash mf, wash-iv p, theme f 8va, violin-theme f, pedal
    Coda  coda in E  — 尾声
      cut, coda-entry, coda-strings, flow mp 92%-75%, cello-pad 35% bars 3-8, violin-pad p bars 5-6, coda 92%-75%, pedal
    Fine  fine in E  — 终
      cut, final

  mix  — playback balance; the score and MIDI ignore it
    violin-theme   +13 dB  attack 200ms
    violin-turn    +13 dB  attack 220ms
    violin-pad     +6 dB
    pizz           +16 dB
    lift-strings   +13 dB  attack 400ms
    coda-strings   +13 dB  attack 50ms
